    },
    "Enabling the hardware gate is irreversible. If this Mac is erased or the Secure Enclave key is lost, the vault cannot be recovered. Reissue stored keys from their providers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enabling the hardware gate is irreversible. If this Mac is erased or the Secure Enclave key is lost, the vault cannot be recovered. Reissue stored keys from their providers."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Hardware-Schutz kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden. Wenn dieser Mac gelöscht wird oder der Schlüssel der Secure Enclave verloren geht, kann der Tresor nicht wiederhergestellt werden. Lass die gespeicherten Schlüssel von ihren Anbietern neu ausstellen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activar la protección por hardware es irreversible. Si se borra este Mac o se pierde la clave de Secure Enclave, la bóveda no podrá recuperarse. Solicita a los proveedores que vuelvan a emitir las claves almacenadas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’activation de la protection matérielle est irréversible. Si ce Mac est effacé ou si la clé Secure Enclave est perdue, le coffre ne pourra pas être récupéré. Réémettez les clés stockées auprès de leurs fournisseurs."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A ativação da proteção por hardware é irreversível. Se este Mac for apagado ou a chave do Secure Enclave for perdida, não será possível recuperar o cofre. Reemita as chaves armazenadas junto aos provedores."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Включение аппаратной защиты необратимо. Если этот Mac будет стёрт или ключ Secure Enclave будет утерян, восстановить хранилище не получится. Получите новые ключи у их поставщиков."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用硬件门控后无法撤销。如果此 Mac 被抹掉或 Secure Enclave 密钥丢失，密钥库将无法恢复。请从提供方重新签发已存储密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Encrypted SSH session. Save it for playback with `asciinema play`.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
