            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Secure Enclave and Touch ID gate vault unlock. The decrypted vault key remains in memory only while the vault is unlocked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave and Touch ID gate vault unlock. The decrypted vault key remains in memory only while the vault is unlocked."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave und Touch ID schützen das Entsperren des Tresors. Der entschlüsselte Tresorschlüssel bleibt nur im entsperrten Zustand im Arbeitsspeicher."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave y Touch ID protegen el desbloqueo de la bóveda. La clave descifrada de la bóveda solo permanece en memoria mientras está desbloqueada."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave et Touch ID contrôlent le déverrouillage du coffre. La clé déchiffrée du coffre reste en mémoire uniquement pendant que celui-ci est déverrouillé."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave e Touch ID controlam o desbloqueio do cofre. A chave descriptografada do cofre permanece na memória somente enquanto o cofre está desbloqueado."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave и Touch ID защищают разблокировку хранилища. Расшифрованный ключ находится в памяти, только пока хранилище разблокировано."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave 和 Touch ID 会为密钥库解锁提供保护。解密后的密钥库密钥仅在密钥库解锁时驻留内存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Secure Enclave and Touch ID gate vault unlock. There is no recovery if the Secure Enclave key is lost.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave and Touch ID gate vault unlock. There is no recovery if the Secure Enclave key is lost."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave und Touch ID schützen das Entsperren des Tresors. Wenn der Secure Enclave-Schlüssel verloren geht, ist keine Wiederherstellung möglich."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave y Touch ID protegen el desbloqueo de la bóveda. No hay recuperación si se pierde la clave de Secure Enclave."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave et Touch ID contrôlent le déverrouillage du coffre. Aucune récupération n’est possible si la clé Secure Enclave est perdue."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave e Touch ID controlam o desbloqueio do cofre. Não há recuperação se a chave do Secure Enclave for perdida."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave и Touch ID защищают разблокировку хранилища. При утрате ключа Secure Enclave восстановление невозможно."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave 和 Touch ID 会为密钥库解锁提供保护。如果 Secure Enclave 密钥丢失，将无法恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Secure Enclave and Touch ID will gate vault unlock. The change is irreversible. Every unlock will require Touch ID. If the Secure Enclave key is lost, the vault cannot be recovered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave and Touch ID will gate vault unlock. The change is irreversible. Every unlock will require Touch ID. If the Secure Enclave key is lost, the vault cannot be recovered."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave und Touch ID werden das Entsperren des Tresors schützen. Die Änderung kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden. Jede Entsperrung erfordert Touch ID. Wenn der Secure Enclave-Schlüssel verloren geht, kann der Tresor nicht wiederhergestellt werden."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave y Touch ID protegerán el desbloqueo de la bóveda. El cambio es irreversible. Cada desbloqueo requerirá Touch ID. Si se pierde la clave de Secure Enclave, la bóveda no podrá recuperarse."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave et Touch ID contrôleront le déverrouillage du coffre. Cette modification est irréversible. Chaque déverrouillage nécessitera Touch ID. Si la clé Secure Enclave est perdue, le coffre ne pourra pas être récupéré."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave e Touch ID controlarão o desbloqueio do cofre. A alteração é irreversível. Todo desbloqueio exigirá Touch ID. Se a chave do Secure Enclave for perdida, não será possível recuperar o cofre."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave и Touch ID будут защищать разблокировку хранилища. Это изменение необратимо. Для каждой разблокировки потребуется Touch ID. При утрате ключа Secure Enclave восстановить хранилище не получится."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave 和 Touch ID 将为密钥库解锁提供保护。此更改无法撤销。每次解锁都需要 Touch ID。如果 Secure Enclave 密钥丢失，密钥库将无法恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
